      "content": "Dylan Everett (born January 24, 1995) is a Canadian actor. He is best known for his roles in \"How To Be Indie\" (2009–2011), \"Wingin' It\" (2010–2013), \"\" (2012–2013), and \"Open Heart\" (2015).",
